    "description": "<p>a part of casting this jutsu, you must target a creature who is Dazed or Stunned.</p>\n<p>Make a melee taijutsu attack, dealing your [Unarmed damage] + 8d10 and forcing the creature to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, their condition persists, extending the duration of it by 1 round.</p>\n<p>Finisher: you instead can make two attacks.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
